      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.2545776367188,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "bacteriologically confirmed TB in people living with HIV was assessed with a meta-analysis of individual",
